# Copy to .env at the repo root. .env is gitignored — never commit real keys.

# Everything runs with no keys at all. A language model enables the "rewrite" and
# "summarise" strategies; without one they are advertised as unavailable and text
# jobs fall back to the offline "rulebased" cleanup.
#
# Configure ONE provider. Anthropic:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides for the Anthropic provider.
# CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# CLAUDE_EFFORT=low

# Or point at any OpenAI-compatible gateway (OpenRouter, Together, local vLLM).
# All three are required; LLM_MODEL has no default because which models a gateway
# offers - and which are free - changes over time. Check the provider's model list.
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
# LLM_API_KEY=
# LLM_MODEL=

# Force a provider when both are configured: anthropic | openai
# LLM_PROVIDER=

# Signs media URLs so uploaded files are not world-readable by path.
# Set a real random value in any shared deployment; all gateway replicas must match.
# FILE_SIGNING_SECRET=
